[unsendable-value] Error: a `shared` cannot hold the function value `to(Int) returns Int`
   ╭─[ example.vaab:2:27 ]
   │
 2 │     let held = Shared.new(work)
   │                           ──┬─  
   │                             ╰─── this is the function value `to(Int) returns Int`, which every task sharing it would hold
   │ 
   │ Help: work the answer out first and pass that instead, or declare the work with `to` and call it by name, since a declared function is never carried across
   │ 
   │ Note: a function value holds on to whatever was around it when it was written, which Vaab has no way to look inside
───╯
